OL,3,GNEWSAEarthquake in town 'sounded like
OL,4,Alorry hit house'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents who heard a loud bang in
OL,7,FGrimsby have spoken of their surprise
OL,8,Fto discover the town had been hit by a
OL,9,Fsmall earthquake.
OL,11,FThe epicentre of the 2.2 magnitude
OL,12,Ftremor was detected in the suburb of
OL,13,FScartho at 18:47 BST on Tuesday, the
OL,14,FBritish Geological Survey (BGS)
OL,15,Fconfirmed.
OL,17,FA BGS spokesperson said that while the
OL,18,Fquake, which had a depth of 1.8 miles
OL,19,F(3km), "wasn't anything out of the
OL,20,Fordinary", it had received 70 responses
OL,21,Ffrom people who had felt it.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
