OL,3,GNEWSAEarthquake in town 'sounded like
OL,4,Alorry hit house'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Forrington, 68, from Grimsby, said
OL,7,Fhe felt his house shake for about a
OL,8,Fsecond, adding: "It sounded just like a
OL,9,Florry had smashed into a house. I
OL,10,Fdidn't think it was an earthquake".
